# Brainrot.com — Product Vision

Brainrot.com is a colorful collectible toy brand living on the internet: create a brainrot from predefined combos, then wear it on merch.

Visual canvas is light (white/off-white). Colors explode on top — not a dark neon/gaming site.

V1 is intentionally simple. **No dynamic AI generation.** Illustrations are pre-generated assets. Data-driven catalogue (~20–30 brainrots).

## User journey

1. Land → instantly get the concept
2. Select traits (Animal, Ingredient/Food, Vibe; optional name)
3. See matching brainrots → pick one illustration
4. Apply to product mockup (T-shirt / Hoodie / Cap)
5. Add to cart

## Generator categories (V1)

- **Animal**: crocodile, chat, grenouille, requin, singe, canard…
- **Ingredient**: banane, fraise, pastèque, ananas, pomme, pizza…
- **Vibe**: italian, cute, cursed, chaotic, luxury…
- Name can be derived from the combo (e.g. Banacrocodilo Bambino)

## Products V1

Only: T-shirt, Hoodie, Cap. Architecture must allow later tote, mug, sticker, poster.

## Priorities (in order)

1. UX / visual impact / DA
2. Fluidity & responsive
3. Architecture & performance

Feel: click → create → choose → share → buy. Not a classic e-commerce shop.
